  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作詞：陳淑華</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>調寄：望春風</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">孤夜無伴守燈下</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">冷風tsūn-tsūn吹</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">國文數學kap自然</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">想著lin-long-se̍h</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">想beh認真來讀冊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">已經是半暝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">電視手機一直迷</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">啥人教--你--ê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">咖啡茶米lim到底</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ǹg望睏意硩</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一更二更過三更</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">愛睏神來揣</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">千斤萬斤目睭皮</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">喙瀾流sì-kè</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">3C產品m̄-thang迷</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">青春不再回</span></p><div><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>作者註：</b>寫tsit首歌ê靈感是uì阮查某囝hia來--ê，阮查某囝今年讀初中一年仔，初中ê功課份量比phīng國校仔來講是ke tsiok濟--ê。伊國小ê時，逐工tńg來到厝，電視就開leh看，看kah伊歡喜tsiah beh去讀冊。拄開始讀初中ê時，tsit个習慣suah雄雄改bē過--來，有一站仔讀冊lóng讀到半暝。好佳哉tsit-má知影按怎分撥伊ê時間，ē-tàng khah早歇睏，mā hōo我khah安心--ah。</span></p><div><br /></div></div><div><div><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報332期，2021年11月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi_3OIYqMAXkjlXXsiZQbCfZSvM1sqk5ejP9FCYnFJ4Q0ai5obBAo7qP5hhDyUR6DXiGEzbzTy2LhRtuaHdVvHC4hB67ehZRGsEjDLB4iupgQXjGNobVTkM0T1MYj0ifvG_oVRtIXc-6HAXIPHf3dfCNwihclSynOgn5qaw-vaxLh94PIE4_fx22yMqFA=s1424\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi_3OIYqMAXkjlXXsiZQbCfZSvM1sqk5ejP9FCYnFJ4Q0ai5obBAo7qP5hhDyUR6DXiGEzbzTy2LhRtuaHdVvHC4hB67ehZRGsEjDLB4iupgQXjGNobVTkM0T1MYj0ifvG_oVRtIXc-6HAXIPHf3dfCNwihclSynOgn5qaw-vaxLh94PIE4_fx22yMqFA=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhkBPxYTk6fJNvj07c7DlWI2eqPOcMaoaTOjc1ERLzjaNRrilOz22jPBF8RbSxSEAuu_Vx5lqMAVAFn_V1niaJfKuIpbeMLTKxJiBJCzJrrWTX3oSZe22U7RhPMZyoYSAxJMbetda9oDNmuByD5axKzKlMCwIirJwIhhfH6fXZ1VnvpTf1nNu56U5yH0g=s3036\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhkBPxYTk6fJNvj07c7DlWI2eqPOcMaoaTOjc1ERLzjaNRrilOz22jPBF8RbSxSEAuu_Vx5lqMAVAFn_V1niaJfKuIpbeMLTKxJiBJCzJrrWTX3oSZe22U7RhPMZyoYSAxJMbetda9oDNmuByD5axKzKlMCwIirJwIhhfH6fXZ1VnvpTf1nNu56U5yH0g=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div></div></div></div>"
